# Add Pagination to Portal Lists

The system currently uses `.all()` or `.limit()` for retrieving data in several list views. This approach will lead to performance issues and high memory usage as data grows. We will implement Flask-SQLAlchemy pagination (`.paginate()`) to address this.

## Proposed Changes

### Global Pagination Template
#### [NEW] `app/templates/includes/pagination.html`
We will create a reusable pagination partial template to render the page links, preserving existing query parameters.

